WEBVTT

00:15.500 --> 00:17.000
Script by Vegapunk Fansubs

00:44.040 --> 00:46.000
Kohza!

00:46.000 --> 00:46.980
Toto-ojisan!

00:46.980 --> 00:48.280
Vivi!
Toto-ojisan!

00:48.280 --> 00:48.290
Toto-ojisan!

00:49.270 --> 00:51.530
Oi!

00:55.040 --> 00:55.940
Pell!

01:07.800 --> 01:09.030
Hey, Pell.

01:09.030 --> 01:09.850
Yes?

01:09.850 --> 01:13.050
Why do you practice fencing everyday?

01:13.050 --> 01:14.700
Because I'm a guardian.

01:14.700 --> 01:17.350
In order to protect this country,

01:17.350 --> 01:18.720
I need to become stronger.

01:18.720 --> 01:20.720
Who are you going to fight?

01:20.720 --> 01:21.680
Well...

01:21.680 --> 01:24.300
It's more about protecting than fighting.

01:24.300 --> 01:25.680
Is it different?

01:25.680 --> 01:27.180
The intention is different.

01:28.250 --> 01:29.310
That's strange.

01:31.810 --> 01:32.750
Papa.

01:32.750 --> 01:34.590
Soon I will reach the country.

01:34.590 --> 01:36.160
Don't be deceived.

01:36.160 --> 01:39.020
That man is not the country's hero.

01:39.020 --> 01:40.740
He's trying to steal Arabasta.

01:43.380 --> 01:45.910
Please don't do anything rash!

01:53.530 --> 01:54.200
What?

01:54.200 --> 01:55.040
What is it?

02:04.160 --> 02:05.450
Okama (gay) way

02:06.200 --> 02:08.650
We caught an Okama!

02:08.650 --> 02:09.850
What're you doing to Carue?!

02:10.570 --> 02:11.940
There's no bait left...

02:11.940 --> 02:14.060
You just ate a while ago, didn't you?!!

02:14.060 --> 02:15.550
But...

02:17.920 --> 02:19.440
Really, swan, swan...

02:19.990 --> 02:23.460
To think, I was rescued by a pirate crew that I don't even know.

02:23.460 --> 02:25.730
This favor, I shall never forget it.

02:25.730 --> 02:27.350
We didn't catch you on purpose.

02:27.350 --> 02:28.630
What're you doing in a place like this?

02:28.630 --> 02:30.270
It's a long story.

02:30.270 --> 02:31.130
Then, never mind.

02:31.130 --> 02:31.420
Huh?

02:31.900 --> 02:33.630
You're so cute!

02:33.890 --> 02:35.670
I really like you.

02:36.280 --> 02:37.630
Weird man.

02:38.000 --> 02:40.030
Even so, at the moment I fell into the sea,

02:40.030 --> 02:41.950
I thought I was done for.

02:41.950 --> 02:43.240
You can't swim?

02:43.240 --> 02:45.900
That's right, I'm a hammer.

02:45.900 --> 02:47.790
Are you a Devil's Fruit user?

02:47.790 --> 02:48.600
That's correct.

02:49.010 --> 02:50.770
I'm a rarity in this world.

02:50.770 --> 02:52.450
I ate the Devil's Fruit!

02:55.450 --> 02:57.430
What's that, not very surprised...

02:57.430 --> 02:58.930
You're nothing unusual.

02:59.190 --> 03:01.090
You're so full of yourself.

03:01.090 --> 03:01.110
There are abilities which you might not know.

03:01.110 --> 03:03.080
Bastard! What you want is to provoke Nami-san, right?!
There are abilities which you might not know.

03:03.080 --> 03:05.060
Since I've already seen so many, there's nothing that can surprise me now.
Bastard! What you want is to provoke Nami-san, right?!

03:05.060 --> 03:06.580
Since I've already seen so many, there's nothing that can surprise me now.

03:06.580 --> 03:07.640
Fine, then.

03:07.640 --> 03:09.700
I'll show you my amusing way of thanking.

03:09.920 --> 03:11.660
Alright! Alright! Show… us…

03:13.350 --> 03:13.580
Oi!

03:19.380 --> 03:20.300
What're you...

03:21.980 --> 03:23.120
No way.

03:23.590 --> 03:25.340
Hey you! What're you doing?!

03:25.750 --> 03:27.980
Wait.

03:27.980 --> 03:30.890
I told you it was amusing.

03:31.880 --> 03:33.850
It's no joke.

03:34.110 --> 03:34.930
It's me!

03:34.930 --> 03:35.860
Do I look like you?

03:35.860 --> 03:36.770
Surprised?

03:38.420 --> 03:41.900
mane: mimicry
This is the ability of the mane mane fruit I ate.

03:41.900 --> 03:42.820
Amazing!

03:43.200 --> 03:45.280
But if I touch myself with my left hand…

03:45.590 --> 03:47.200
Look! I'm back to normal.

03:47.690 --> 03:48.400
The voice too...

03:48.400 --> 03:49.550
Even the complexion...

03:49.550 --> 03:50.470
To be honest.

03:51.420 --> 03:52.210
The truth is...

03:52.720 --> 03:56.080
It isn't really necessary to hit...

03:57.910 --> 03:58.820
Don't touch me.

03:58.820 --> 03:59.540
Well, it's okay.

03:59.770 --> 04:00.670
But if I...

04:01.090 --> 04:02.720
With my right hand...

04:03.120 --> 04:05.380
Touch the face of my partner...

04:07.370 --> 04:09.300
Like this, I can...

04:10.460 --> 04:12.750
Imitate anyone.

04:13.600 --> 04:14.870
My body too.

04:17.610 --> 04:18.740
Stop it!

04:18.740 --> 04:19.610
Ouch!

04:20.010 --> 04:20.910
You're amazing!

04:20.910 --> 04:21.820
Amazing!

04:22.410 --> 04:26.780
Furthermore, I can use my memory ability.

04:27.400 --> 04:28.170
The faces...

04:28.470 --> 04:29.130
I touched...

04:29.400 --> 04:30.230
Before...

04:30.590 --> 04:31.290
I definitely...

04:31.640 --> 04:32.360
Won't...

04:32.680 --> 04:33.250
Forget.

04:36.530 --> 04:37.410
How is it?

04:37.410 --> 04:39.080
My hidden talent.

04:39.080 --> 04:40.600
So cool!

04:40.600 --> 04:42.500
It's no joke!

04:42.500 --> 04:43.900
Do whatever you want...

04:46.590 --> 04:48.730
Hey, isn't that your ship?

04:48.730 --> 04:50.800
Oh? Time to part already?

04:52.400 --> 04:53.980
Don't be sad!

04:53.980 --> 04:55.270
Farewells are natural things.

04:56.070 --> 04:57.900
But, just don't forget this...

04:58.090 --> 04:59.620
In friendship...

05:00.620 --> 05:03.360
The time we've known each other doesn't matter!

05:03.460 --> 05:06.070
Let's meet again!

05:06.460 --> 05:09.120
Well, let's go guys!

05:09.120 --> 05:10.780
Bon: Festival of the Dead; Kure: Year End
Yes! Bon Kurei-sama!

05:11.480 --> 05:12.240
Eh?!

05:12.500 --> 05:13.580
Bon Kurei?

05:14.030 --> 05:14.450
Vivi?

05:15.080 --> 05:16.660
Crocodile's subordinate!

05:17.140 --> 05:18.960
Didn't you recognize his face?

05:19.240 --> 05:21.420
I've never met him until now.

05:22.120 --> 05:24.180
When he looked back into his memory,

05:24.180 --> 05:25.380
My father's face was there.

05:27.900 --> 05:29.660
Why my father's face...

05:29.660 --> 05:32.420
For example, if you disguise yourself as a king…

05:33.280 --> 05:35.390
You can do some bad things…

05:37.730 --> 05:39.310
Dance powder… that guy…

05:39.810 --> 05:41.070
What is that?

05:41.070 --> 05:44.410
A powder that can make artificial rainfall.

05:44.410 --> 05:47.760
The World Government prohibited its production.

05:47.760 --> 05:49.640
That's a useful powder…

05:49.640 --> 05:50.640
Why not use it?

05:50.640 --> 05:51.780
Dance powder, right?

05:52.660 --> 05:55.180
It makes clouds that aren't ready for rainfall…

05:55.180 --> 05:59.440
Artificially grow into maturity in order to make it rain.

05:59.440 --> 06:03.100
It steals the rain from neighboring countries.

06:03.100 --> 06:07.300
And because of the frequent disputes between them…

06:07.300 --> 06:10.220
The World Government had to prohibit it, huh?

06:10.890 --> 06:12.030
2 years ago,

06:12.030 --> 06:17.810
A large quantity of dance powder arrived to the port city of Arabasta, Nanohana.

06:17.810 --> 06:21.160
At that time, except for Alubarna where the king lives,

06:21.160 --> 06:24.090
Abnormal incidents of rain not falling occurred.

06:24.090 --> 06:26.520
So they got suspicious of the king.

06:26.520 --> 06:26.530
As if he used that powder to posses the rain.
So they got suspicious of the king.

06:26.530 --> 06:30.190
As if he used that powder to posses the rain.

06:30.190 --> 06:30.200
Vivi!
As if he used that powder to posses the rain.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.030
Vivi!

06:31.030 --> 06:31.040
Then, your father is a bad guy!
Vivi!

06:31.040 --> 06:33.230
Then, your father is a bad guy!

06:33.230 --> 06:35.240
Idiot! He was framed!

06:35.270 --> 06:38.100
Vivi's father wouldn't do such a thing.

06:38.100 --> 06:39.520
He wouldn't.

06:39.520 --> 06:41.490
It's as Sanji-san says.

06:41.490 --> 06:44.210
My father isn't an egoistical person, so something must have happened.

06:45.230 --> 06:49.640
At the port, the appearance of the person receiving the cargo was witnessed,

06:49.640 --> 06:51.050
And judging by the hat he was wearing...

06:51.050 --> 06:54.920
The identity of the man who was transporting the dance powder to the palace is now very clear.

06:55.400 --> 06:57.760
I see, that guy was disguised as the king.

06:58.540 --> 07:00.600
We let such a troublesome guy get away.

07:01.090 --> 07:04.690
Everything was the plan of Crocodile, his organization's boss.

07:05.170 --> 07:07.690
As he expected, it caused rebellion.

07:07.690 --> 07:08.900
I see.

07:09.780 --> 07:12.670
Make the royal army and the rebel army clash,

07:12.670 --> 07:16.070
So when both are weakened, he'll steal the throne.

07:16.070 --> 07:17.830
He disguises himself as the country's hero.

07:18.560 --> 07:20.940
He stole the royal family's trust, the rain,

07:20.940 --> 07:23.830
Even people's lives, and created disorder in Arabasta!

07:24.280 --> 07:25.630
That's Crocodile!

07:31.800 --> 07:33.550
Amazing!

07:40.250 --> 07:42.500
Crocodile! Crocodile!

07:42.500 --> 07:45.350
Sir Crocodile!

07:45.350 --> 07:48.120
The Protector God of Arabasta!

07:48.120 --> 07:50.180
The King of the Desert!

07:50.180 --> 07:52.780
Crocodile! Crocodile!

07:54.380 --> 07:55.910
Shut up, you ignorant fools!

07:56.460 --> 08:00.010
Even if you say that, you always come and rescue us.

08:00.010 --> 08:00.370
He's fantastic!

08:02.180 --> 08:04.780
Well, call it whatever you want.

08:07.260 --> 08:10.610
Your Majesty, Crocodile-sama has arrived.

08:15.810 --> 08:18.430
It's a present, Mr. Cobra.

08:19.970 --> 08:21.140
We always receive your help.

08:23.170 --> 08:24.040
It's fine.

08:24.040 --> 08:28.040
The royal army takes care of the rebel army. I take care of pirates.

08:28.040 --> 08:30.480
Well, I'll leave the disposal of this trash to you.

08:32.260 --> 08:33.190
By the way,

08:33.960 --> 08:37.750
I heard the rebel army was making a disturbance.

08:37.750 --> 08:38.950
What do you plan to do?

08:39.640 --> 08:41.710
The country is the people.

08:41.710 --> 08:44.410
If they intend to come and attack us, there's nothing to do.

08:45.120 --> 08:46.350
I see.

08:49.800 --> 08:51.980
We'll meet again before long.

08:52.970 --> 08:56.130
Anyway, this time there will be too many enigmas.

08:56.130 --> 08:56.760
I see.

08:57.290 --> 09:00.220
If we use this, there's no reason to distrust our nakama.

09:00.530 --> 09:02.570
Using a double mark, huh?

09:02.570 --> 09:04.910
It's a very clever strategy.

09:04.910 --> 09:06.610
Could it be that you're the okama bastard?

09:06.950 --> 09:08.290
I'll slice you up! Bastard!

09:08.290 --> 09:09.220
Oh, it's Zoro.

09:09.220 --> 09:10.270
So it's Zoro...

09:11.180 --> 09:11.730
Yosh!

09:12.140 --> 09:14.170
From now on, if anything happens,

09:14.170 --> 09:16.040
Show this on your left arm!

09:16.040 --> 09:16.570
Yeah!

09:24.200 --> 09:26.760
It's the mark of nakama!

09:29.180 --> 09:30.620
Let's land!

09:30.880 --> 09:32.620
At Arabasta!

09:32.620 --> 09:34.330
Yeah!

09:35.910 --> 09:36.550
Papa.

09:37.870 --> 09:41.500
I'll definitely stop the rebel army.

09:53.720 --> 10:00.480
The Desert Princess and the Pirates.
Episode of Arabasta

10:01.050 --> 10:03.130
I'm thirsty...

10:03.130 --> 10:04.720
You sure are evil...

10:04.720 --> 10:08.120
Stealing our precious water and food.

10:08.120 --> 10:11.770
Soon we'll arrive at the rebel army headquarters in Yuba.

10:11.770 --> 10:14.130
But, will we really be okay?

10:14.610 --> 10:16.930
A lot of blood is going to my head...

10:16.930 --> 10:17.540
It's alright.

10:18.880 --> 10:20.880
We'll surely manage to persuade them.

10:24.590 --> 10:26.150
This is horrible.

10:26.150 --> 10:26.610
It's covered with sand...

10:26.610 --> 10:27.550
Where's the water?
It's covered with sand...

10:27.550 --> 10:27.940
Hey, water.
It's covered with sand...

10:27.940 --> 10:28.680
Wasn't there an oasis here?
Hey, water.

10:28.680 --> 10:30.310
Where are you water?
Wasn't there an oasis here?

10:30.310 --> 10:30.760
Water...

10:31.200 --> 10:33.270
The sand has covered the earth...

10:36.370 --> 10:37.220
Someone's there.

10:37.220 --> 10:39.520
Eh? Really?

10:40.710 --> 10:42.430
Travelers, right?

10:42.430 --> 10:45.000
A journey in the desert is tiring, isn't it?

10:45.000 --> 10:48.860
Sorry, this town is all dried up.

10:49.320 --> 10:50.830
Um...

10:50.830 --> 10:53.680
We heard the rebel army was in this town so...

10:54.340 --> 10:55.180
You!

10:55.810 --> 10:59.290
Could it be that you people want to join the rebel army!

11:00.240 --> 11:02.900
They're no longer in this town.

11:03.380 --> 11:04.540
No way!

11:04.540 --> 11:06.000
What's going on, Vivi?

11:07.420 --> 11:07.720
You just said Vivi...

11:07.720 --> 11:09.470
Umm...I...
You just said Vivi...

11:09.470 --> 11:10.580
Oi, Ossan!

11:10.580 --> 11:12.140
Vivi is not the princess!

11:12.510 --> 11:13.410
Don't say it!

11:13.410 --> 11:14.750
Is that you Vivi-chan?

11:14.750 --> 11:16.240
Am I right?

11:16.240 --> 11:18.400
You're alive, I'm glad!

11:18.400 --> 11:19.250
It's me.

11:19.250 --> 11:20.620
Don't you recognize me?

11:20.620 --> 11:21.870
Toto-ojisan?

11:21.870 --> 11:22.530
That's right!

11:23.130 --> 11:24.250
No way!

11:24.250 --> 11:26.400
You've become… so thin…

11:26.400 --> 11:29.920
What? It's no big deal.

11:29.920 --> 11:34.700
I still believe in Vivi-chan and His Majesty.

11:34.920 --> 11:38.420
That man is definitely not the type that will betray the country.

11:39.020 --> 11:40.270
Am I right?

11:40.270 --> 11:41.820
I'm counting on you, Toto.

11:41.820 --> 11:45.380
I'll make sure Yuba becomes a prosperous town with abundant greenery.

11:46.130 --> 11:47.600
We'll build an amazing town,

11:47.600 --> 11:49.850
And make this country much more prosperous.

11:50.670 --> 11:51.860
See you, Vivi.

11:51.860 --> 11:56.840
Suna: Sand
Don't forget the pride of the Suna Suna Clan you got as sub-leader, and become a fine princess!

11:56.840 --> 11:58.230
Yes, Leader.

11:58.230 --> 11:59.230
It's a promise!

12:00.080 --> 12:02.210
See ya!

12:02.210 --> 12:03.740
Rebellion is such a foolish thing.

12:04.650 --> 12:08.230
I tried to stop him many times, and yet...

12:08.230 --> 12:11.750
When they heard a rumor that the royal army was being used to invade...

12:11.750 --> 12:14.030
They went towards Nanohana.

12:14.030 --> 12:15.410
The royal army is in Nanohana?

12:15.970 --> 12:17.160
Toto-ojisan, when was that?

12:18.230 --> 12:19.670
About 5 hours ago.

12:30.190 --> 12:31.500
We're too late.

12:31.500 --> 12:33.140
What a terrible situation.

12:33.140 --> 12:35.680
But, where'd the royal army go?

12:36.450 --> 12:38.800
We came here hoping we might encounter them...

12:39.820 --> 12:41.870
This isn't the time to talk.

12:41.870 --> 12:43.520
Let's help everyone in town.

12:44.140 --> 12:45.500
Stay calm.

12:45.500 --> 12:46.360
Don't push the ones in front.

12:46.740 --> 12:47.930
To the west side of town!

12:47.930 --> 12:49.070
Run into the wind!

12:49.650 --> 12:50.840
Hang in there.

12:50.840 --> 12:52.110
There's still more to save.

12:52.110 --> 12:52.450
Be strong.

12:52.940 --> 12:56.290
The king... ordered to... burn the town...

12:56.290 --> 12:57.410
Don't talk!

12:58.050 --> 13:00.380
Oi! Kid, are you alright?

13:00.750 --> 13:02.640
Damn! Even the kids!

13:02.640 --> 13:03.610
Damn Cobra!

13:03.610 --> 13:05.260
His degradation has gone this far.

13:05.260 --> 13:08.220
At this rate, only death awaits Arabasta!

13:08.220 --> 13:09.200
Kohza!

13:09.860 --> 13:12.110
Contact everyone...

13:12.110 --> 13:13.790
Kohza, then...

13:13.790 --> 13:14.920
Yeah.

13:14.920 --> 13:16.560
We'll finish this country.

13:17.180 --> 13:19.470
The current Arabasta is already dead!

13:19.470 --> 13:21.110
This is the last battle!

13:21.110 --> 13:22.770
We'll invade Alubarna!

13:35.810 --> 13:38.120
Operation Utopia.

13:38.120 --> 13:40.380
The first step was completed nicely but,

13:40.380 --> 13:45.370
The arrival of Princess Vivi and the Strawhats to this place was not part of the calculations.

13:45.370 --> 13:48.260
But, that's not a big problem.

13:48.920 --> 13:55.510
Now, we have to prevent the princess and the young leader of the rebel army, Kohza, from making contact.

13:55.510 --> 13:57.680
Then, we'll move on to the second step.

13:58.730 --> 13:59.640
Good luck.

14:02.930 --> 14:04.560
It's almost time.

14:04.560 --> 14:07.890
By tomorrow, the Kingdom of Arabasta will be mine.

14:07.890 --> 14:10.780
We'll change it into our Utopia.

14:11.420 --> 14:13.480
The world's most terrifying ancient weapon...

14:13.950 --> 14:17.450
Once I have Pluton in my hands, this will become a great military country.

14:18.050 --> 14:20.270
Kohza and the others are already at their limits...

14:20.270 --> 14:23.370
They're even ready to die.

14:23.640 --> 14:27.630
I beg you Vivi-chan, please stop those fools.

14:28.700 --> 14:31.090
Toto-ojisan, don't worry.

14:31.090 --> 14:31.590
Vivi-chan.

14:32.120 --> 14:34.180
We'll definitely stop the rebellion.

14:35.140 --> 14:35.850
Vivi...

14:42.890 --> 14:46.370
Well then, we are leaving, Toto-ojisan.

14:46.370 --> 14:46.990
Yes.

14:46.990 --> 14:48.700
Please, take this with you.

14:48.700 --> 14:49.740
Oh! Water!

14:49.740 --> 14:50.710
Water!

14:50.710 --> 14:53.970
Can there really be water in such a dried up place?

14:53.970 --> 14:57.310
Yes, after all, Yuba won't lose to some sand.

14:57.310 --> 14:59.280
I excavated it yesterday after one week of trying.

14:59.450 --> 15:02.450
It's genuine Yuba water.

15:02.450 --> 15:03.960
Such precious water.

15:03.960 --> 15:04.960
Thank you!

15:04.960 --> 15:06.380
I will treasure it.

15:06.380 --> 15:07.310
See ya!

15:07.310 --> 15:08.370
Dried up-ossan.

15:24.570 --> 15:26.320
What's wrong, Luffy?

15:27.310 --> 15:28.590
Luffy-san?

15:28.590 --> 15:29.530
I quit.

15:30.920 --> 15:32.480
What do you mean by "I quit"?

15:32.910 --> 15:36.070
You know, we have no time for your jokes.

15:36.460 --> 15:37.610
We're going to stop the rebel army, right?

15:37.990 --> 15:39.250
Of course.

15:39.250 --> 15:40.050
It's pointless.

15:40.050 --> 15:40.950
What was that?!

15:42.690 --> 15:43.400
Vivi.

15:45.020 --> 15:48.080
I'm gonna kick Crocodile's ass.

15:49.810 --> 15:53.700
If we stop the rebels, will Crocodile stop?

15:54.310 --> 15:55.170
Well...

15:55.170 --> 15:58.270
This guy... once in a while has a point.

15:58.270 --> 15:59.260
Even though it's Luffy.

15:59.740 --> 16:04.050
You don't want anyone to die in this battle.

16:04.050 --> 16:06.520
The country's people, us, everyone.

16:07.910 --> 16:09.680
Aren't you being too naïve?

16:10.870 --> 16:13.940
Shouldn't I think that way?

16:14.450 --> 16:17.870
What's wrong with not wanting people to die?

16:17.870 --> 16:19.110
People die.

16:23.490 --> 16:25.740
Stop talking that way!

16:25.740 --> 16:27.680
If you say it again, I won't forgive you!

16:27.680 --> 16:31.580
The royal army, the rebel army, and the people of this country haven't done anything bad.

16:32.150 --> 16:34.290
Why can't I wish for people not to die?

16:35.990 --> 16:39.500
Then, why are you risking your life?!

16:39.520 --> 16:40.060
Oi! You're over doing it!

16:40.060 --> 16:40.710
Bastard!
Oi! You're over doing it!

16:41.190 --> 16:44.480
After seeing this country, we know what's the most important thing to do...

16:44.480 --> 16:45.210
What is it?!

16:45.210 --> 16:46.560
We all know!

16:47.030 --> 16:50.930
Do you think that risking your life is enough?

16:50.930 --> 16:54.190
Then, what else shall I risk?!

16:54.190 --> 16:56.080
Is there anything else...?

16:56.080 --> 16:59.210
Is there anything else I can risk?!

16:59.210 --> 17:00.160
I don't have anything...

17:02.200 --> 17:05.740
Try risking our lives together!

17:06.300 --> 17:08.290
We're nakama!

17:16.090 --> 17:19.190
What… the tears came out.

17:20.100 --> 17:22.650
The truth is, if you're the one suffering the most.

17:22.650 --> 17:24.610
I will kick those guys' asses.

17:40.960 --> 17:42.290
Show us.

17:42.290 --> 17:43.520
Crocodile's whereabouts.

17:45.040 --> 17:47.660
The royal army burnt down Nanohana?

17:47.660 --> 17:49.660
Such order was never given.

17:49.660 --> 17:52.420
It might be a trap from the rebel army.

17:52.420 --> 17:54.450
Assemble the entire army at once.

17:55.900 --> 17:57.880
Chaka, gather the officers.

17:57.880 --> 17:59.690
Assemble a battle formation.

17:59.690 --> 18:02.580
Pell, fly and inspect the enemy formation.

18:02.580 --> 18:03.340
Is that clear?

18:03.340 --> 18:05.300
We'll attack the rebel army.

18:05.650 --> 18:07.260
Resist to the very end!

18:08.100 --> 18:09.440
What're you doing?

18:09.440 --> 18:10.390
Yes!

18:11.840 --> 18:15.090
With this, they'll be confused.

18:15.090 --> 18:17.060
Mission accomplished.

18:21.410 --> 18:22.980
Amazing, so fast!

18:23.420 --> 18:27.330
Matsuge says that, since he was born in this area, he has a lot of friends around here.
Matsuge: Eyelashes

18:27.330 --> 18:29.450
T-thank you, Matsuge.

18:31.240 --> 18:32.220
Luffy-san.

18:32.670 --> 18:37.630
Thank you.  I don't know how to repay you for helping me make this important decision.

18:37.630 --> 18:38.280
Is that so?

18:38.280 --> 18:39.840
Give me food.

18:40.380 --> 18:43.380
If I beat Crocodile, give me some food to die for.

18:44.940 --> 18:45.840
Yes.

18:46.670 --> 18:48.140
Just you wait.

18:48.140 --> 18:53.360
Cro-co-di-le!

18:55.040 --> 18:56.080
What's this?

18:58.310 --> 18:59.480
Stop Chopper!

18:59.480 --> 19:00.100
Got it.

19:07.870 --> 19:08.800
Vivi!

19:10.000 --> 19:12.960
Did you call for me, Strawhat Luffy?

19:13.110 --> 19:13.960
Get away from Vivi!

19:16.630 --> 19:17.350
Alright!

19:17.350 --> 19:19.170
So you're Crocodile?!

19:21.030 --> 19:22.090
Don't shout.

19:28.480 --> 19:30.220
Vivi-sama, why're you here?

19:30.220 --> 19:30.680
Pell!

19:40.020 --> 19:41.240
Bastard!

19:41.590 --> 19:42.660
What did you do?!

19:42.660 --> 19:43.400
Seis Fleur: Six Flower
Seis Fleur.

19:48.450 --> 19:48.910
Clutch.

19:50.930 --> 19:51.790
Pell!

19:53.010 --> 19:55.620
The kingdom's best warrior isn't a big deal.

19:56.420 --> 19:58.080
What are these guys?

19:59.190 --> 20:00.300
It's useless.

20:00.800 --> 20:03.530
The party has already begun.

20:03.530 --> 20:05.130
Isn't that right, Miss All Sunday?

20:06.050 --> 20:06.840
Yes.

20:08.520 --> 20:09.300
It can't be...

20:10.020 --> 20:11.760
To Alubarna!

20:14.030 --> 20:18.870
The rebel army got weapons from a merchant ship in Nanohana...

20:18.870 --> 20:20.230
And with those, they began the attack.

20:22.230 --> 20:26.160
And so, the royal army intends to start a full scale attack.

20:26.160 --> 20:27.530
We will protect Arabasta!

20:28.950 --> 20:30.490
Doesn't it make you cry?

20:30.760 --> 20:33.950
Their love for this country will be the thing that destroys it.

20:35.880 --> 20:37.420
It's not too late yet...

20:37.420 --> 20:40.950
If I manage to get to the palace at Alubarna before the rebel army...

20:40.950 --> 20:43.920
We might stop this conflict.

20:44.160 --> 20:45.670
What a guy...

20:45.670 --> 20:48.520
The word "traitor" describes this guy perfectly.

20:49.080 --> 20:50.140
Where's Luffy?

20:56.180 --> 20:57.140
Zoro!

21:03.550 --> 21:05.110
You guys go ahead.

21:05.110 --> 21:06.700
I'll take care of this!

21:06.700 --> 21:07.610
Strawhat...

21:07.980 --> 21:09.030
Hurry up and leave!

21:10.120 --> 21:10.760
Chopper.

21:10.760 --> 21:11.490
Go, hurry!

21:13.760 --> 21:15.080
Are you stupid?

21:15.080 --> 21:16.680
Like I'll let you leave without...

21:18.600 --> 21:20.080
Your opponent is over here!

21:21.180 --> 21:22.290
Brat...

21:25.750 --> 21:27.340
So they escaped after all.

21:27.770 --> 21:28.690
Luffy-san!

21:28.690 --> 21:31.350
Vivi, he'll be fine.

21:31.350 --> 21:35.850
So far, once Luffy picks his opponent, there's no one that has gotten away unharmed.

21:35.850 --> 21:36.740
Listen, Vivi.

21:37.470 --> 21:39.310
He will keep Crocodile busy.

21:39.910 --> 21:40.860
Gomu Gomu no

21:41.010 --> 21:41.610
Pistol

21:49.160 --> 21:50.690
Crocodile will be defeated by him.

21:51.600 --> 21:53.760
The instant the rebel army started to advance...

21:53.760 --> 21:56.100
This country's time limit had been decided.

21:56.100 --> 21:58.620
And if you are the only hope for stopping them...

21:59.480 --> 22:00.790
We'll keep you alive no matter what.

22:00.850 --> 22:02.250
Gatling

22:03.350 --> 22:05.710
From here on, anything that happens to anyone here...

22:06.450 --> 22:08.090
Doesn't matter.

22:10.540 --> 22:12.090
Bazooka

22:12.550 --> 22:14.060
It's like the marimo says.

22:14.060 --> 22:16.680
You won't have to think of fighting alone anymore.

22:16.680 --> 22:19.650
Vi-Vi-Vivivi... you don't have to worry...

22:19.650 --> 22:21.540
Y-you can count on me...

22:22.070 --> 22:22.930
Luffy-san.

22:25.710 --> 22:27.850
I'll be waiting in Alubarna.

22:31.410 --> 22:32.510
Damn it...

22:32.510 --> 22:34.140
I can't hit him at all.

22:34.140 --> 22:35.600
He keeps dissolving!

22:35.600 --> 22:38.320
Our pirate levels are too different, Strawhat Luffy.

22:39.420 --> 22:41.250
Play time is over.

22:42.580 --> 22:43.870
Espada: Sword
Desert Espada

22:49.600 --> 22:51.590
Eh? The desert was cut?!

22:51.830 --> 22:53.380
Impressive, you saw through it.

22:53.380 --> 22:55.080
Girasol: Sunflower
Desert Girasol

22:58.650 --> 23:00.220
What? What? What?

23:00.580 --> 23:02.510
Haven't you heard of quicksand?

23:02.510 --> 23:04.520
There's no need for a gravestone, it's a desert coffin.

23:05.060 --> 23:07.780
You're now being dragged into an underground waterway.

23:07.780 --> 23:11.440
There's no one in this world that can match me in a desert battle.

23:11.840 --> 23:14.600
Like I'm gonna get buried alive by some sand.

23:15.200 --> 23:16.360
Gomu Gomu no

23:16.360 --> 23:17.410
Bazooka

23:18.380 --> 23:19.490
Gomu Gomu no

23:19.660 --> 23:20.720
Stamp

23:22.150 --> 23:22.700
It's no use.

23:23.890 --> 23:24.540
Barehand.

23:28.170 --> 23:30.050
My leg turned into a mummy!

23:30.050 --> 23:33.840
It's because the sand has absorbed your moisture.

23:34.130 --> 23:36.690
You gotta be kidding.

23:36.690 --> 23:37.050
That's right!

23:41.720 --> 23:42.760
Restored!

23:42.760 --> 23:43.840
Useless.

23:43.840 --> 23:45.010
It's not useless!

23:45.310 --> 23:49.650
The dried up-ossan dug this water, it's very precious water!

23:49.650 --> 23:51.150
Ossan said so!

23:51.590 --> 23:53.650
Yuba won't lose to just some sand!

24:03.770 --> 24:06.330
Who do you think I am?

24:06.640 --> 24:09.970
There are many rookies like you…

24:11.620 --> 24:14.750
There're many of them, Strawhat Luffy...

24:15.360 --> 24:18.180
On this Grand Line.

24:35.060 --> 24:36.160
It can't be...

24:36.160 --> 24:37.110
He's still alive...

24:40.060 --> 24:41.450
It's painful, isn't it?

24:41.450 --> 24:43.500
But, you'll soon be at peace.

24:44.810 --> 24:46.530
What a waste of time.

24:50.750 --> 24:53.290
Princess Vivi is heading to Alubarna,

24:53.290 --> 24:56.040
Contact the agents.

24:56.040 --> 24:56.670
I understand.

25:00.790 --> 25:02.590
Why do you fight?

25:02.950 --> 25:05.070
You people who hold the name "D"...

25:11.810 --> 25:15.140
Vivi, how much further until we reach the palace?

25:15.140 --> 25:16.310
Maybe about 50 km.

25:16.570 --> 25:17.710
Still that much?

25:17.710 --> 25:18.650
We're not gonna make it...
Still that much?

25:18.650 --> 25:19.350
Hasami: Scissors
Can't we speed up, Hasami-kun?
We're not gonna make it...

25:19.350 --> 25:21.740
Can't we speed up, Hasami-kun?
Hasami: Scissors

25:22.250 --> 25:23.270
That's right!

25:23.270 --> 25:24.780
Hasami really likes dancers.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.960
Is this fine?

25:34.680 --> 25:35.380
He's looking this way.

25:38.500 --> 25:39.260
We accelerated!

25:39.260 --> 25:40.270
Pervert Power!

25:40.270 --> 25:42.030
Nami-swan!

25:42.030 --> 25:44.720
Controlling two idiots with the same trick.

25:47.730 --> 25:49.640
If we keep going this fast, we might be able to do something.

25:49.990 --> 25:52.200
However, don't get too confident yet.

25:52.200 --> 25:52.850
Yeah.

25:57.220 --> 25:58.690
The king disappeared, you say?!

25:59.290 --> 26:02.200
I looked all over the palace, but he's nowhere!

26:02.200 --> 26:06.080
Besides, we've confirmed the rebel army, about 20 km to the south.

26:07.660 --> 26:09.000
Defend all the gates!

26:09.000 --> 26:11.070
Don't let them take even one step into this town.

26:11.070 --> 26:11.290
Yes!

26:23.260 --> 26:25.140
Since they're coming here from Yuba...

26:25.140 --> 26:28.010
If we stick to the west gate, there's no way we won't notice them.

26:28.260 --> 26:30.580
They plan on getting here before the rebel army.

26:30.580 --> 26:31.950
Do they think they can stop them?

26:31.950 --> 26:32.970
They.. are... coming...
Geez.

26:32.970 --> 26:35.310
They.. are... coming...

26:35.310 --> 26:36.070
What?
They.. are... coming...

26:36.070 --> 26:38.380
daruma: Japanese tumbling doll
Say it faster! You slow daruma!

26:38.380 --> 26:39.530
My hip!

26:40.820 --> 26:41.610
A moving crab...

26:42.240 --> 26:44.270
W-with six people!

26:44.690 --> 26:47.530
Don't bother with the others, our target is only Vivi.

26:47.770 --> 26:48.910
"Only" you say?

26:49.250 --> 26:49.990
Then you...

26:50.520 --> 26:52.950
Which one is Vivi, I can't tell the difference.

26:53.160 --> 26:54.770
These guys...

26:54.770 --> 26:55.710
They're using the same mantle!

26:56.270 --> 26:57.660
This is so confusing!

27:00.210 --> 27:02.180
We'll take care of those two!

27:02.180 --> 27:03.600
Let's go Mr. 4!

27:03.600 --> 27:04.250
Y-e-s...

27:06.480 --> 27:08.070
They split again!

27:08.070 --> 27:10.420
They're planning on getting inside separately.

27:10.420 --> 27:11.180
After them.

27:11.490 --> 27:12.550
Then I...

27:12.920 --> 27:14.180
Un... Deux...

27:20.070 --> 27:22.150
You're not getting away!

27:26.440 --> 27:28.320
Thank you, everyone.

27:32.930 --> 27:34.910
Is it okay that you came all this way?

27:36.370 --> 27:38.040
You guys made the correct choice,

27:38.040 --> 27:39.760
I'm Princess Vivi.

27:39.760 --> 27:40.970
What're you saying...

27:40.970 --> 27:41.890
I told you.

27:41.890 --> 27:43.130
I'm the real Vivi!

27:45.410 --> 27:47.300
Good job on getting this far.

27:48.280 --> 27:50.760
Now, let's show them our true face!

27:50.760 --> 27:51.780
It's a shame...

27:51.780 --> 27:53.030
You fail!

27:54.110 --> 27:54.930
The Princess Vivi...

27:55.170 --> 27:56.640
Where'd she go?!

27:57.560 --> 27:58.100
I'll kill you!

28:02.240 --> 28:04.230
I'm sorry!

28:10.010 --> 28:12.660
The rebel army should be coming soon.

28:39.640 --> 28:41.070
Leader...

28:41.070 --> 28:42.600
Listen to what I have to say...

28:43.040 --> 28:44.110
Everyone!

28:44.110 --> 28:45.880
Just a little more to break through the south gate!

28:45.880 --> 28:48.540
Next, we will attack from inside the front gate.

28:48.540 --> 28:49.820
Get ready!

28:53.630 --> 28:54.730
Please stop!

28:54.730 --> 28:55.740
Rebel army!

29:02.470 --> 29:04.630
This battle was planned!

29:09.360 --> 29:09.770
What was that?

29:09.770 --> 29:11.200
With this, the visibility...

29:12.490 --> 29:14.350
What a foolish thing to do...

29:15.110 --> 29:16.600
The royal army?

29:17.200 --> 29:19.700
I haven't given the order to fire yet!

29:19.700 --> 29:22.430
I-I'm really sorry...

29:22.430 --> 29:23.020
My hand slipped...

29:23.770 --> 29:25.980
Don't act on your own!

29:25.990 --> 29:28.040
Do not falter! Advance!

29:28.040 --> 29:29.200
It's just sand dust!

29:29.420 --> 29:30.300
Stop!

29:30.300 --> 29:31.650
Everyone! Wait!

29:32.440 --> 29:33.880
We're doing this for the country!

29:33.880 --> 29:35.640
The king won't be forgiven!

29:35.640 --> 29:37.310
Leader!

29:41.760 --> 29:43.120
Was it my imagination?

29:52.140 --> 29:53.200
Leader?

29:59.020 --> 30:00.520
Chaka-sama, your orders!

30:03.110 --> 30:04.060
Open fire!

30:04.600 --> 30:05.310
Shoot!

30:06.010 --> 30:08.110
Don't let them get inside!

30:09.670 --> 30:10.830
Don't falter!

30:10.830 --> 30:13.360
Attack Alubarna!

30:15.570 --> 30:17.990
Reinforce the protection of the south gate.

30:43.730 --> 30:44.390
Carue!

30:44.950 --> 30:46.940
You covered me.

30:48.310 --> 30:49.570
I'm sorry...

30:51.020 --> 30:54.740
Even thought we got here, the rebellion started.

30:54.740 --> 30:56.360
But I'll stop them.

30:56.660 --> 30:58.990
No matter how many times I get rejected.

30:58.990 --> 31:02.320
Just like I learned on the ship, I can't give up.

31:10.220 --> 31:11.340
Usopp!

31:13.330 --> 31:14.670
Santouryuu

31:18.000 --> 31:18.730
Ushibari: Bull Horns

31:28.360 --> 31:29.110
Stinger

31:31.160 --> 31:31.500
Step

31:39.040 --> 31:40.970
At this rate, we won't settle it.

31:40.970 --> 31:42.660
I got it now!

31:43.100 --> 31:45.160
I'm gonna get really serious now!

31:46.790 --> 31:48.040
Try it.

31:53.480 --> 31:55.240
Are you really alright?

31:56.770 --> 32:00.090
Okay, but don't push yourself.

32:11.700 --> 32:14.560
We can't search for Kohza within this fray.

32:15.460 --> 32:18.120
The fight has only started in this place...

32:18.120 --> 32:20.050
Let's go to the palace to see Chaka!

32:26.130 --> 32:27.410
Carue?!

32:35.120 --> 32:35.540
Carue!

32:41.160 --> 32:41.970
I understand.

32:47.200 --> 32:48.850
You are...

32:55.160 --> 32:56.230
Please take care of Carue!

33:01.210 --> 33:03.710
That idio-! Is he your captain?!

33:03.710 --> 33:05.680
He was killed by the Boss.

33:05.680 --> 33:07.810
He's no pirate king.

33:08.350 --> 33:10.330
Geez, I'm glad he's dead.

33:10.330 --> 33:12.660
He was an idiot that didn't know who he was dealing with.

33:13.150 --> 33:15.080
You'll die too, Long-nose!

33:16.600 --> 33:18.170
Listen, Chopper!

33:18.170 --> 33:19.570
For a man!

33:19.570 --> 33:20.760
Mogurazuka: Molehill
Mogurazuka Highway

33:28.190 --> 33:30.530
4 Ton Bat position!

33:30.530 --> 33:31.230
Here we go,

33:31.230 --> 33:32.270
Mogurazuka...

33:35.410 --> 33:36.830
Yonban Kousaten: Intersection No. 4

33:39.460 --> 33:40.480
Usopp!

33:43.810 --> 33:44.860
Bastards!

33:45.490 --> 33:46.520
You...!

33:48.420 --> 33:50.270
No matter who the enemy is...

33:50.270 --> 33:53.310
There's a time when you must fight...

33:53.310 --> 33:54.380
You still...!

33:54.380 --> 33:58.790
That time is... when someone makes fun of the dream of a nakama.

34:00.310 --> 34:02.460
Luffy can't be dead.

34:02.460 --> 34:06.510
Because he'll definitely become the Pirate King!

34:06.760 --> 34:09.220
Don't you dare make fun of that!

34:10.280 --> 34:11.360
One more time.

34:11.360 --> 34:12.130
Take position!

34:15.100 --> 34:17.190
Like I'd let you do that!

34:19.520 --> 34:21.920
Chopper, get behind me!

34:21.920 --> 34:22.730
Got it!

34:23.110 --> 34:23.860
Take this!

34:23.860 --> 34:24.380
Hissatsu!

34:24.550 --> 34:25.180
Here we go

34:25.180 --> 34:26.090
Mogurazuka

34:27.450 --> 34:28.680
Kemuri Boshi: Smoke Star

34:31.390 --> 34:33.510
I'll leave it to you, Chopper!

34:33.510 --> 34:35.250
That kid took off his shoes!

34:37.590 --> 34:38.450
What?!

34:38.450 --> 34:40.210
Mogurazuka Yonban Kousaten!

34:41.390 --> 34:42.990
W-wait! It's me!

34:44.130 --> 34:45.580
Idio-! Sto...

34:51.600 --> 34:52.410
Hissatsu

34:52.410 --> 34:53.610
UsoCho: Usopp & Chopper

34:56.520 --> 34:58.830
Hammer Comet

35:35.320 --> 35:37.760
Even you doubt Papa, Leader?

35:38.270 --> 35:40.070
Go back, someone will hear you.

35:40.070 --> 35:40.850
Wait.

35:40.850 --> 35:42.310
I'll definitely prove it to you.

35:43.140 --> 35:45.280
So please, stop the fight!

35:46.790 --> 35:48.240
Vivi!

35:51.050 --> 35:52.030
Are you alright, Kohza?

35:54.180 --> 35:57.870
Now, I will enter the palace to demand Cobra's surrender.

35:58.150 --> 35:59.390
Don't be foolish.

35:59.390 --> 36:02.250
The royal army's main force is surrounding the palace.

36:02.530 --> 36:04.970
It isn't necessary for you to go there alone!

36:05.780 --> 36:07.220
It's too late...

36:07.770 --> 36:08.930
Cover me.

36:08.930 --> 36:10.640
Oi! Kohza!

36:11.510 --> 36:12.490
You!

36:12.490 --> 36:14.600
The townspeople must hurry up and take refuge.

36:15.270 --> 36:17.280
Leave this town at once!

36:18.760 --> 36:20.520
Are you listening, woman?

36:21.510 --> 36:22.670
Vivi-sama?

36:24.270 --> 36:25.690
Vivi-sama!

36:26.920 --> 36:29.180
Please take me to where Chaka is.

36:29.180 --> 36:30.900
There's something I need to discuss with him.

36:40.060 --> 36:41.920
Make them retreat!

36:43.530 --> 36:44.460
Fight them back!

36:48.290 --> 36:49.720
Don't falter!

36:49.720 --> 36:50.420
Advance!

36:59.530 --> 37:04.350
You seem to be nothing more than words, right?

37:04.690 --> 37:07.560
You... damn... okama bastard...

37:07.560 --> 37:08.820
Stop messing...

37:09.020 --> 37:11.020
Around.

37:11.510 --> 37:13.860
Damn... so cute...

37:15.380 --> 37:19.580
But, this country is really hot...

37:20.860 --> 37:22.910
I feel like getting rid of these clothes

37:23.190 --> 37:24.760
Need a hand?!

37:24.760 --> 37:25.870
Okama Chop

37:25.870 --> 37:27.500
My eyes!

37:27.830 --> 37:28.810
It's about time...

37:28.810 --> 37:31.600
To end this!

37:36.620 --> 37:37.800
Okama Kenpou

37:38.390 --> 37:39.870
That day of summer...

37:39.870 --> 37:41.270
Memories

37:42.160 --> 37:42.890
You... could it be...

37:46.230 --> 37:47.150
Joue: Cheek

37:47.960 --> 37:49.700
Shot

37:53.240 --> 37:55.360
I've seen through the mane mane fruit.

37:55.840 --> 37:57.900
What?

37:57.900 --> 38:02.240
In the moment before you attack me, you're forced to turn back into an okama.

38:02.960 --> 38:05.450
As long as you're Nami-san, you can't use your kenpou, right?

38:05.470 --> 38:06.460
Sign: Bull's-eye

38:06.780 --> 38:09.540
Eh? I can't hear you at all!

38:09.540 --> 38:10.920
I got the correct answer, didn't I?

38:11.440 --> 38:13.520
So what?!

38:15.660 --> 38:18.340
Let me show you, the okama kenpou...

38:18.340 --> 38:18.870
Prima!

38:20.860 --> 38:21.470
Un...

38:22.110 --> 38:22.610
Deux...

38:31.930 --> 38:32.680
Longe: Loin

38:33.350 --> 38:33.960
Tendron: Collar

38:39.930 --> 38:41.300
Cuisseau: Thigh

38:41.610 --> 38:42.200
Jarret: Shank

38:42.780 --> 38:44.580
Un... Deux... Trois

39:02.600 --> 39:05.000
Bombardier Arabesque

39:05.000 --> 39:06.990
Veau: Veal
Veau Shot

39:30.820 --> 39:34.050
There's quite a number of broken bones again.

39:42.200 --> 39:44.020
Protect Alubarna!

39:45.010 --> 39:47.860
Capture Sir Crocodile?

39:48.070 --> 39:51.230
If only everyone could see me for a few seconds...

39:51.230 --> 39:53.240
I might be able to do something.

39:53.650 --> 39:54.740
Destroy...

39:56.340 --> 39:57.490
This palace!

39:58.410 --> 40:00.520
What're you saying, Princess?

40:00.520 --> 40:02.270
Have you lost your mind?

40:02.270 --> 40:04.610
Vivi-sama, if we do something like that...

40:04.610 --> 40:06.370
If we do something like that, what?

40:06.940 --> 40:08.880
This country will be finished?

40:09.710 --> 40:10.920
You're wrong.

40:10.920 --> 40:12.470
They said,

40:12.470 --> 40:13.690
This is only the beginning...

40:14.830 --> 40:15.470
Of the country!

40:18.020 --> 40:18.430
Listen...

40:19.340 --> 40:21.560
The country is the people.

40:26.230 --> 40:27.370
Vivi-sama.

40:30.730 --> 40:32.260
As you wish.

40:33.110 --> 40:33.890
Soldiers.

40:33.890 --> 40:36.700
Set all the gathered gunpowder around the palace base!

40:36.870 --> 40:37.950
Impossible.

40:37.950 --> 40:39.980
They actually intend to do it...

40:39.980 --> 40:42.510
A royal palace that has 4000 years of history.

40:44.430 --> 40:46.530
If we don't gain something from this solution...

40:46.530 --> 40:48.280
It's okay, I'm aware of it.

40:48.280 --> 40:52.420
You won't have any other way to counter the rebel army.

40:52.940 --> 40:56.130
I'm sorry, the country is in an emergency situation.

40:56.500 --> 40:59.050
However, it isn't over yet.

40:59.050 --> 41:00.990
Even if we manage to stop this rebellion,

41:00.990 --> 41:04.410
As long as Crocodile is alive, this country will not have peace.

41:06.120 --> 41:07.240
This bothers me.

41:10.350 --> 41:12.190
Isn't this a dangerous thing to do?

41:12.420 --> 41:15.090
Soon this place will become my house.

41:15.090 --> 41:16.900
Crocodile!

41:23.010 --> 41:25.320
Well, well, if it isn't the princess.

41:26.060 --> 41:26.740
Papa!

41:26.740 --> 41:27.410
Your Majesty!

41:29.700 --> 41:31.420
Vivi, why're you here?

41:35.310 --> 41:35.950
Well?

41:35.950 --> 41:36.760
Have you resigned?

41:37.270 --> 41:38.680
That would be you!

41:38.680 --> 41:40.010
Thunderbolt Tempo

41:42.750 --> 41:44.420
Sparkling Deity

41:47.820 --> 41:48.520
Blow away.

41:59.080 --> 41:59.900
Unforgivable.

42:04.670 --> 42:06.000
Sea Urchin

42:06.370 --> 42:07.570
Stinger

42:13.320 --> 42:17.180
This doesn't hurt... even a bit...

42:18.160 --> 42:20.840
Can you understand her pain?

42:21.310 --> 42:22.730
Compared to that...

42:22.730 --> 42:25.430
1, 2, or 3 legs...

42:25.430 --> 42:26.560
Don't matter!

42:27.630 --> 42:30.030
Tornado Tempo

42:44.560 --> 42:46.230
What? What? What?!

43:26.930 --> 43:28.210
Why...?

43:29.600 --> 43:32.500
Why are you here?!

43:32.920 --> 43:33.830
Where's Luffy-san?!

43:34.310 --> 43:35.540
He died.

43:35.780 --> 43:36.700
You're lying!

43:36.700 --> 43:39.880
There's no way Luffy-san would get killed by you!

43:40.840 --> 43:42.280
You think so?

43:43.850 --> 43:44.640
The door just!

43:44.910 --> 43:46.040
Go back to the palace.

43:46.040 --> 43:47.220
Open the gate!

43:47.590 --> 43:49.730
Dieciséis Fleur: Sixteen Flowers

43:50.820 --> 43:51.430
What?

43:51.430 --> 43:52.480
Hands?

43:56.420 --> 43:58.520
Why you... Crocodile!

43:59.080 --> 44:01.340
Idiots should be quiet.

44:01.340 --> 44:04.820
Cobra, I have just one question for you.

44:05.400 --> 44:08.360
Because this is my ultimate goal,

44:11.380 --> 44:13.540
Where's Pluton?

44:30.390 --> 44:32.390
Spiral Hollow

44:58.690 --> 45:00.920
I... am not at his level...

45:07.700 --> 45:08.840
Spar Break

45:34.200 --> 45:34.990
Bastard!

45:34.990 --> 45:36.290
What the hell did you do?

45:36.290 --> 45:37.620
Just getting hit with that technique...

45:38.400 --> 45:40.220
I can hear it.

45:40.220 --> 45:42.380
His iron's breathing...

45:43.100 --> 45:44.490
Fine.

45:44.490 --> 45:47.300
With the next strike, I'll totally stop your breathing.

45:50.520 --> 45:54.220
Don't think that you can stop my technique with just one katana.

45:55.820 --> 45:56.970
It's okay.

45:58.170 --> 45:59.690
I won't get hit anymore.

46:00.130 --> 46:01.840
You seem prepared...

46:01.840 --> 46:03.150
Fine then!

46:04.070 --> 46:06.410
Ittouryuu Iai: One Sword Style Sword Draw

46:06.410 --> 46:08.110
Shishi Sonson: Lion Song

46:08.520 --> 46:10.370
Atomic Spurt

46:28.640 --> 46:30.390
I thank you.

46:34.950 --> 46:35.810
Idiot...

46:36.220 --> 46:37.430
Why're you crying?

46:37.430 --> 46:39.180
Because that mole-hag said...

46:39.180 --> 46:41.400
Luffy is dead.

46:41.910 --> 46:43.110
I wonder if it's true.

46:43.940 --> 46:45.440
You guys believe that?

46:45.770 --> 46:48.570
Like I'm gonna believe it! You idiot!

46:48.570 --> 46:49.380
Me neither!

46:49.380 --> 46:50.900
I definitely don't believe it!

46:51.360 --> 46:55.330
In that case, we need to hurry and catch up with everyone.

46:55.330 --> 46:57.340
Wipe your nose.

46:57.340 --> 46:59.590
This bloodshed must be stopped.

47:07.080 --> 47:08.550
Finally got it.

47:17.430 --> 47:19.440
Where's Pluton?

47:22.620 --> 47:24.900
Bastard... how do you know that name...?

47:25.320 --> 47:27.070
Such a thing is... in this country...?

47:27.510 --> 47:29.780
The secret passed down with the throne succession...

47:32.050 --> 47:36.890
If I have it, I can build the greatest military country.

47:36.890 --> 47:40.700
A country with the power to even surpass that of the World Government.

47:40.900 --> 47:43.800
I don't know where you heard the name of Pluton, but...

47:43.800 --> 47:46.160
Even I don't know its whereabouts.

47:46.160 --> 47:49.420
I'm not sure if that thing even exists.

47:49.590 --> 47:51.000
I see...

47:51.690 --> 47:54.890
By the way, the plaza where the royal army is gathered...

47:55.120 --> 47:56.590
Today at 4:30 p.m., in other words,

47:56.590 --> 48:01.310
In 15 minutes, a powerful bomb will be shot according to the plan.

48:02.870 --> 48:04.350
Are you insane, bastard?!

48:04.750 --> 48:07.410
Its explosion will cover 5 km in diameter.

48:07.410 --> 48:10.900
From this place, we could have a nice view of the change in the landscape.

48:10.900 --> 48:11.880
If you do such a thing...!

48:11.880 --> 48:12.670
Aren't you happy?

48:12.670 --> 48:16.490
When both armies die, this rebellion will finally end.

48:16.490 --> 48:19.230
What have they ever done to you!

48:19.230 --> 48:19.900
Vivi-sama.

48:19.900 --> 48:22.240
How can you do such a thing?!

48:22.790 --> 48:26.460
Well then, Mr. Cobra, back to the question.

48:26.460 --> 48:29.260
The poneglyph that has been passed down for generations by the royal family...

48:29.260 --> 48:30.380
Where is it?

48:31.710 --> 48:34.300
If I take you to that place...

48:34.800 --> 48:36.090
No,

48:36.090 --> 48:38.510
I'll guide you... to the Hall of Burials.

48:40.250 --> 48:41.780
You're a wise ruler, Cobra.

48:41.780 --> 48:43.970
Accompany him to the Hall of Burials, Nico Robin.

48:44.290 --> 48:45.010
Understood.

48:56.140 --> 48:57.260
Papa!

48:57.260 --> 48:57.810
Hey,

48:58.500 --> 49:00.450
Who said you could go?

49:00.880 --> 49:03.760
Get your hands off Vivi-sama, traitor!

49:05.330 --> 49:06.920
Oh? Zoan type.

49:07.160 --> 49:07.170
Inu inu fruit, model jackal.

49:07.170 --> 49:09.330
Inu: Dog
Inu inu fruit, model jackal.

49:10.500 --> 49:11.560
Nari Kiba: Roaring Fang

49:16.950 --> 49:17.880
Chaka...

49:19.230 --> 49:21.560
You also intend to die for the sake of a stranger...?

49:21.560 --> 49:22.100
Vivi!

49:22.570 --> 49:23.110
Kohza!

49:23.110 --> 49:25.050
Are my eyes deceiving me?

49:25.280 --> 49:28.900
The rebel army leader shouldn't show up in this place!

49:33.930 --> 49:34.590
Kohza...

49:34.590 --> 49:36.350
Hang in there, Kohza!

49:36.910 --> 49:40.240
I came to... try to persuade the royal army... but...

49:41.550 --> 49:43.340
Everything was...

49:45.130 --> 49:46.330
My doing...

49:47.100 --> 49:48.620
Kohza.

49:50.980 --> 49:52.510
Zoro! Zoro!

49:52.510 --> 49:53.710
Wake up!

49:56.120 --> 49:58.570
This place has become very violent.

49:58.570 --> 49:59.130
Let's hurry!

50:01.230 --> 50:04.420
Without the king or the leader of the rebellion...

50:04.420 --> 50:08.100
This has already become lizards with their heads ripped off killing each other.

50:13.730 --> 50:15.130
A sudden sandstorm...

50:15.130 --> 50:16.510
I can't see what's in front.

50:18.200 --> 50:19.210
Don't falter!

50:19.210 --> 50:20.110
Hit them!

50:20.810 --> 50:22.580
What's with this storm?

50:22.870 --> 50:25.220
Don't lose formation!

50:26.160 --> 50:28.290
Fire back! Royal army!

50:40.680 --> 50:42.260
I...

50:42.550 --> 50:44.180
Can't give up.

50:44.410 --> 50:48.350
If we stop the explosion, we can decrease the number of victims.

50:48.700 --> 50:50.510
If I do this I can stop the rebellion.

50:50.510 --> 50:52.060
If I do that I can stop the rebellion.

50:52.280 --> 50:55.780
Your pathetic idealism disgusts me.

50:55.780 --> 50:57.990
I don't care if it disgusts you...

50:57.990 --> 50:59.490
I won't abandon my ideals...

50:59.810 --> 51:01.450
A very devoted woman you are.

51:01.640 --> 51:04.640
In the end, you couldn't stop anything.

51:04.640 --> 51:08.420
The only thing your attachment to your idealism caused was an increase in the number of innocent victims!

51:08.420 --> 51:10.410
I already told you!

51:10.940 --> 51:13.990
You can't save this country!

51:21.910 --> 51:23.840
Vivi...

51:24.120 --> 51:25.800
Vivi!

51:26.520 --> 51:27.760
VIVI!

51:28.710 --> 51:30.220
Luffy... san.

51:30.800 --> 51:32.040
Don't...

51:32.040 --> 51:33.190
GIVE UP YET!

51:33.750 --> 51:34.690
Luffy-san!

51:40.400 --> 51:41.770
Just in time.

51:42.510 --> 51:44.510
Luffy-san... Pell...

51:45.400 --> 51:48.560
My voice won't reach anyone anymore...

51:48.560 --> 51:49.450
Don't worry.

51:50.590 --> 51:53.470
We can hear your voice.

51:55.090 --> 51:55.580
Zoro.

51:55.580 --> 51:56.750
Look at that! Over there!

51:57.670 --> 51:59.550
Luffy is alive! Vivi too!

52:00.560 --> 52:01.750
Didn't I tell you?!

52:01.750 --> 52:02.680
I knew it all along!

52:03.100 --> 52:04.640
Is that the look of a guy who knew?

52:05.560 --> 52:07.650
Wait for me, Vivi-chan!

52:07.650 --> 52:08.950
Let's hurry up, Zoro!

52:08.950 --> 52:12.210
It's evident my wounds are more serious.

52:12.210 --> 52:14.600
My feet are hurt, I can't stand up!

52:14.600 --> 52:15.600
Liar.

52:16.700 --> 52:19.200
You can read the poneglyph?

52:19.200 --> 52:20.010
Yes.

52:20.010 --> 52:23.350
That's the main reason I associated with Crocodile.

52:23.350 --> 52:25.070
That's why he won't kill me.

52:26.240 --> 52:27.030
I see.

52:27.590 --> 52:29.750
The location of Pluton... as I thought is...

52:33.230 --> 52:35.200
Is there any other?

52:35.200 --> 52:37.590
Is this the only one in this country?

52:37.590 --> 52:38.630
Are you disappointed...?

52:38.630 --> 52:39.380
I kept my promise...

52:39.380 --> 52:40.170
Why?!
I kept my promise...

52:43.140 --> 52:45.910
What I seek isn't here either...

52:45.910 --> 52:47.840
Was it as he said, Nico Robin?

52:48.560 --> 52:50.170
That was fast.

52:50.170 --> 52:51.950
Did you managed to decipher it?

52:51.950 --> 52:52.310
Yes.

52:52.710 --> 52:54.380
In that case, hurry up and tell me Pluton's whereabo...

52:54.380 --> 52:56.210
It's not written here.

52:56.210 --> 52:56.770
What?

52:57.020 --> 52:59.230
Nothing more than history is written here.

53:00.130 --> 53:03.840
Nothing like the word Pluton appears here.

53:03.840 --> 53:05.450
I see, it's a shame.

53:06.070 --> 53:08.160
You have been an excellent partner but,

53:08.800 --> 53:10.450
You're going to die right here.

53:13.460 --> 53:15.350
I'm putting an end to all this!

53:15.670 --> 53:16.510
Yes!

53:17.620 --> 53:18.830
Vivi!

53:19.040 --> 53:20.390
Vivi-chan!

53:20.390 --> 53:21.290
Are you alright?

53:23.020 --> 53:23.840
Vivi!

53:24.200 --> 53:26.300
We're also here!

53:27.590 --> 53:29.260
Everyone is safe...

53:33.440 --> 53:34.930
Are you alright, Luffy-kun?

53:35.110 --> 53:36.220
Yeah...

53:37.680 --> 53:39.850
What you see below is the Hall of Burials.

53:40.100 --> 53:41.180
I see.

53:41.180 --> 53:42.580
Just you wait...!

53:42.580 --> 53:44.650
Croc!

53:53.360 --> 53:55.740
Just 5 minutes to search for the bombardiers?

53:56.190 --> 53:59.730
Crocodile created this sandstorm in order to...

53:59.730 --> 54:03.710
Hide the bomb that is going to be fired at the plaza, so the bombardiers must be nearby.

54:05.860 --> 54:07.170
Then, high places should be suspected.

54:07.650 --> 54:08.630
High places?

54:08.880 --> 54:12.540
It's gonna be a 5 km in diameter blast, so that's the most probable thing to do.

54:12.540 --> 54:15.600
Besides, it's more reliable to shoot down from above than from the ground.

54:16.040 --> 54:17.560
Amazing, Usopp!

54:17.560 --> 54:19.640
I'm a sniper after all.

54:19.640 --> 54:20.770
That's enough information.

54:20.770 --> 54:21.360
Let's hurry.

54:21.360 --> 54:22.640
Yes!
Oi!

54:22.640 --> 54:24.410
I was born a talented genius...

54:24.410 --> 54:27.120
Equal parts natural ability and heredity...

54:27.120 --> 54:28.740
Huh? Wait...

54:29.020 --> 54:30.450
Water?

54:31.180 --> 54:33.410
But it's meaningless if you can't hit me.

54:35.730 --> 54:38.200
I forgive everything, Nico Robin.

54:38.200 --> 54:39.290
Because I...

54:39.650 --> 54:41.750
From the very beginning...

54:42.600 --> 54:45.210
Didn't trust anyone!

54:45.370 --> 54:49.170
I can tell by Cobra's reaction that Pluton really exists.

54:49.560 --> 54:51.030
I'll just search for it myself.

54:51.030 --> 54:54.850
When this country falls into my hands, it'll be just a matter of time.

55:03.390 --> 55:05.790
It's still too soon for the bombardment on the plaza.

55:05.790 --> 55:06.440
You?!

55:06.900 --> 55:11.650
This Hall of Burials was designed to collapse upon the removal of a single stone.

55:12.330 --> 55:15.830
Under the name of the twelfth king in the Nefertari dynasty.

55:15.830 --> 55:18.580
I won't let you have this country of sand.

55:18.690 --> 55:21.690
So you want to bury me alive in this place.

55:21.690 --> 55:24.540
You're such a devoted king.

55:24.920 --> 55:26.750
But, I can't be killed.

55:26.930 --> 55:30.020
If I turn everything into sand I can get out.

55:31.240 --> 55:34.990
You'll die in vain, Mr. Cobra.

55:42.940 --> 55:44.390
Found you, croc.

55:44.710 --> 55:45.470
You.

55:45.470 --> 55:47.020
How did you escape from that quicksand...?

55:47.530 --> 55:48.980
Why're you alive?

55:49.580 --> 55:53.380
Why do you keep standing in my way?!

55:53.380 --> 55:55.660
Eh?! Strawhat!

55:58.920 --> 56:01.450
You haven't returned it yet...

56:02.480 --> 56:03.920
What you stole.

56:04.200 --> 56:05.820
What I stole?

56:05.820 --> 56:06.790
Money?

56:07.250 --> 56:08.250
Fame?

56:08.650 --> 56:09.710
Trust?

56:10.200 --> 56:11.170
Lives?

56:11.600 --> 56:12.630
Rain?

56:12.690 --> 56:13.750
The country!

56:24.360 --> 56:25.820
Impossible...

56:27.160 --> 56:31.030
Crocodile!

56:35.570 --> 56:37.570
You... it can't be...

56:38.310 --> 56:40.100
When I was stuck in the desert...

56:40.100 --> 56:43.520
I realized it when your hand touched Yuba's water.

56:43.520 --> 56:46.760
If you touch water, you can't turn into sand.

56:46.760 --> 56:47.830
But, blood is the same, isn't it?

56:49.150 --> 56:50.360
Fine then.

56:50.360 --> 56:55.050
I'll let you see hell one more time as a reward for your tenacity in challenging me.

56:55.400 --> 56:56.470
As a pirate.

56:57.870 --> 56:58.590
What's that?

56:59.330 --> 57:00.600
Poison needle.

57:01.130 --> 57:01.890
I see.

57:02.410 --> 57:06.350
A pirate's duel is a survival battle in which you put your life on the line.

57:06.810 --> 57:09.310
Words such as "unfair" don't exist in it.

57:10.120 --> 57:12.030
This is the last one.

57:13.450 --> 57:14.990
Let's finish this once and for...

57:14.990 --> 57:15.990
All!

57:16.930 --> 57:18.670
What're you doing?!

57:18.670 --> 57:20.110
Thinking like Crocodile...

57:20.110 --> 57:21.330
Shut up and keep searching!

57:21.900 --> 57:23.030
Chopper!

57:23.030 --> 57:24.750
Can't you find it using your nose?

57:24.870 --> 57:25.770
Impossible.

57:25.770 --> 57:27.960
The whole town is filled with the smell of gunpowder.

57:28.060 --> 57:30.920
Then, follow the scent of whatever is aiming at the plaza...

57:30.920 --> 57:32.420
What smell is that?!

57:32.640 --> 57:34.490
Anyway, it's a huge bomb.

57:34.490 --> 57:36.380
And it also needs room to shoot out of the cannon and fall down.

57:40.620 --> 57:42.680
There's no time left.

57:51.070 --> 57:52.230
Oi!

57:52.230 --> 57:52.810
What's wrong, Vivi?

57:53.240 --> 57:55.410
Why didn't I realize it...

57:55.410 --> 57:58.310
It has to be there, a spacious place people wouldn't notice.

57:58.310 --> 58:00.870
The place where I used to play when I was little.

58:00.870 --> 58:01.590
Vivi, if we don't hurry...

58:01.590 --> 58:02.320
Vivi! Usopp!

58:02.720 --> 58:03.550
Did you find it?

58:03.550 --> 58:04.280
Well, no, that...

58:04.280 --> 58:05.970
Usopp-san, I got it!

58:05.970 --> 58:06.680
Really?

58:06.680 --> 58:07.710
Then, I'll call everyone.

58:13.240 --> 58:14.290
So, where is it?

58:14.290 --> 58:14.760
Over there!

58:16.910 --> 58:18.860
It's impossible in 1 minute.

58:18.860 --> 58:19.930
Nami-san!

58:20.380 --> 58:21.390
Vivi-chan!

58:21.390 --> 58:23.850
You guys, did you find the bombardiers?

58:26.050 --> 58:28.330
Why in the world are you up there?!

58:28.330 --> 58:29.640
Huh? I unintentionally...

58:29.910 --> 58:32.280
Usopp! Hurry, we're out of time!

58:32.280 --> 58:33.360
T-that's right.

58:33.760 --> 58:36.310
Honestly, there's no way we can make it in time.

58:36.310 --> 58:37.820
If only Pell came...

58:38.160 --> 58:40.580
The bombardiers are above the clock tower!

58:40.580 --> 58:42.600
You guys jump to the clock place!

58:42.600 --> 58:43.280
Don't talk nonsense!

58:43.530 --> 58:45.730
Use your legs or katana, but do something!

58:45.730 --> 58:46.240
That's it!

58:54.500 --> 58:59.590
Gero gero: The sound a frog makes
Gero, gero, gero, gero…

58:59.920 --> 59:02.800
Gero, gero, gero, the trophy from before sure was big.

59:03.090 --> 59:04.290
That's right.

59:13.430 --> 59:15.190
Gero, gero, gero, gero, but,

59:15.190 --> 59:17.110
This time I think it'll be even bigger.

59:17.360 --> 59:18.900
That's right.

59:19.440 --> 59:23.530
We just have to shoot this huge cannonball into the middle of the crowd.

59:23.530 --> 59:24.420
Isn't it good?

59:58.200 --> 59:59.570
Gomu Gomu no

01:00:32.740 --> 01:00:34.560
Soon the poison will take effect.

01:00:34.560 --> 01:00:35.720
The battle is over.

01:00:35.720 --> 01:00:37.190
So what?!

01:00:38.480 --> 01:00:40.570
You don't understand anything at all.

01:00:42.190 --> 01:00:43.030
What...

01:00:43.790 --> 01:00:45.450
Understand?

01:00:58.710 --> 01:00:59.840
Gomu Gomu no

01:01:00.880 --> 01:01:02.920
Gatling

01:01:14.340 --> 01:01:16.080
Don't you understand?

01:01:16.080 --> 01:01:18.770
You're already dead.

01:01:19.460 --> 01:01:22.250
The poison already entered through your wound.

01:01:35.980 --> 01:01:37.490
It's over.

01:01:38.450 --> 01:01:39.340
What?

01:01:46.820 --> 01:01:47.470
Why?

01:01:47.980 --> 01:01:49.960
Why do you go that far?!

01:01:50.490 --> 01:01:53.360
Your goal isn't in this country!

01:01:53.360 --> 01:01:55.430
Will you die for such a thing?!

01:01:56.170 --> 01:01:58.730
You all are so stupid.

01:01:58.730 --> 01:01:59.900
Vivi...

01:02:00.760 --> 01:02:03.720
She tells other people not to die..

01:02:03.720 --> 01:02:07.970
But she's always the first one to throw away her life in order to save other people.

01:02:08.990 --> 01:02:10.860
If we leave her alone, she'll die.

01:02:11.170 --> 01:02:13.630
Yes, as you just said, I sent her to the next world...

01:02:13.630 --> 01:02:14.830
Idiot!

01:02:15.160 --> 01:02:16.760
Vivi is safe.

01:02:16.760 --> 01:02:19.130
There's no way I'll let her die.

01:02:19.130 --> 01:02:20.350
I don't...

01:02:20.350 --> 01:02:22.510
I don't want her to die...!

01:02:23.650 --> 01:02:24.790
We're nakama!

01:02:25.580 --> 01:02:29.260
That's why, as long as she doesn't give up on the country,

01:02:29.260 --> 01:02:32.390
We won't stop fighting!

01:02:33.090 --> 01:02:35.350
Even if you die?

01:02:36.210 --> 01:02:38.830
When I die... that will be...

01:02:38.830 --> 01:02:39.270
That...

01:02:47.980 --> 01:02:50.280
It doesn't matter how much you shout.

01:02:50.280 --> 01:02:53.530
Eventually your body will stop responding to you.

01:02:54.100 --> 01:02:56.490
It doesn't matter how much you and your nakama struggle...

01:02:56.800 --> 01:03:01.410
It doesn't matter how many times you stand up to thwart my plan...

01:03:01.410 --> 01:03:02.540
Everything...

01:03:03.050 --> 01:03:05.500
Rests on whether you can defeat me.

01:03:06.020 --> 01:03:08.460
Gero, it's about time Mr.7.

01:03:09.160 --> 01:03:11.430
Preparing to ignite.

01:03:12.080 --> 01:03:14.540
Gero, gero, ignite!

01:03:19.690 --> 01:03:22.140
Oi! Nami! What're you trying to do?!

01:03:22.310 --> 01:03:23.180
Shut up!

01:03:23.180 --> 01:03:25.070
Just be quiet and stand there.

01:03:25.070 --> 01:03:26.190
I'm calculating right now.

01:03:26.420 --> 01:03:27.950
Even if you say stand there,

01:03:27.950 --> 01:03:29.190
I can't understand the meaning of this posture.

01:03:29.190 --> 01:03:30.540
If I do it, you'll understand.

01:03:30.540 --> 01:03:31.680
Here I go!

01:03:31.680 --> 01:03:32.820
The weather is typhoon!

01:03:33.490 --> 01:03:35.810
Cyclone Tempo

01:03:36.880 --> 01:03:37.930
O-oi!

01:03:37.930 --> 01:03:40.690
Cyclone tempo is just an instrument to have fun at parties...

01:03:42.450 --> 01:03:43.780
The objective is the clock tower.

01:03:43.780 --> 01:03:44.620
Chopper!

01:03:44.620 --> 01:03:46.040
Jump to where Sanji-kun is!

01:03:48.020 --> 01:03:49.550
Could it be that, the plan is...

01:03:49.550 --> 01:03:51.800
To keep flying until we reach the top?

01:03:52.260 --> 01:03:53.170
Sanji-kun!

01:03:53.170 --> 01:03:54.260
You know the rest, right?

01:03:54.630 --> 01:03:55.760
There's no time!

01:03:55.760 --> 01:03:58.980
I can somewhat tell what Nami-san's intentions are...

01:03:58.980 --> 01:03:59.430
Yosh!

01:03:59.430 --> 01:04:00.220
There's nothing but to do it!

01:04:00.770 --> 01:04:02.530
There's no time to think about it.

01:04:02.530 --> 01:04:03.730
Please, Tony-kun.

01:04:04.460 --> 01:04:05.110
Yosh!

01:04:05.110 --> 01:04:06.230
Hang on tight!

01:04:07.510 --> 01:04:08.440
I see.

01:04:08.670 --> 01:04:09.980
Sanji!

01:04:09.980 --> 01:04:11.040
Get onto my right leg!

01:04:12.310 --> 01:04:13.780
There they go, Zoro!

01:04:14.790 --> 01:04:16.740
Yosh, as I thought!

01:04:21.560 --> 01:04:23.290
Zoro!

01:04:24.490 --> 01:04:25.780
Leave it to me.

01:04:25.780 --> 01:04:26.880
Katana?!

01:04:27.270 --> 01:04:28.270
Don't be scared.

01:04:28.270 --> 01:04:29.920
I'm using the back of the swords.

01:04:29.920 --> 01:04:30.940
Got it!

01:04:30.940 --> 01:04:31.880
Fly!

01:04:32.830 --> 01:04:34.730
Go!

01:04:36.910 --> 01:04:37.500
Gero?

01:04:39.260 --> 01:04:40.730
Here we go, Vivi!

01:04:40.730 --> 01:04:41.970
Please, give it all you got!

01:04:42.370 --> 01:04:43.980
Go!

01:04:44.570 --> 01:04:46.770
Kujakki: Peacock
Kujakki String

01:04:50.560 --> 01:04:51.850
Slasher

01:04:51.850 --> 01:04:53.170
Gero, gero, it's a shame.

01:04:53.170 --> 01:04:54.070
You missed.

01:04:54.770 --> 01:04:55.780
Run back.

01:04:56.100 --> 01:04:57.280
Alright!

01:04:59.720 --> 01:05:00.240
Sorry.

01:05:16.820 --> 01:05:19.720
It's over!

01:05:27.280 --> 01:05:28.650
D-did she stop it?

01:05:29.960 --> 01:05:31.850
How long are you planning on staying there...!

01:05:31.850 --> 01:05:32.970
What happened?

01:05:32.970 --> 01:05:34.890
Vivi hasn't come out.

01:05:42.410 --> 01:05:43.330
It can't be...

01:05:44.770 --> 01:05:46.290
What a cowardly act!

01:05:46.780 --> 01:05:50.320
That's what you call being careful in an assault.

01:05:50.320 --> 01:05:51.250
Mr. Cobra.

01:05:51.820 --> 01:05:55.220
You should make preparations for every possible accident in the plan.

01:05:55.710 --> 01:05:57.430
The difference is 2 minutes.

01:06:01.030 --> 01:06:02.800
This can't be...

01:06:02.970 --> 01:06:05.320
The bomb has a timer!

01:06:06.150 --> 01:06:07.980
At this rate, it will blow up!

01:06:12.060 --> 01:06:14.280
What did you say?!

01:06:15.230 --> 01:06:19.360
Preventing the destruction of the plaza was impossible from the beginning?

01:06:22.120 --> 01:06:24.210
How long are you going to make fun of people...

01:06:24.780 --> 01:06:27.580
You can't save the country.

01:06:28.320 --> 01:06:31.330
How long until you're satisfied with ridiculing the people?

01:06:44.950 --> 01:06:47.140
There's no way...

01:06:56.490 --> 01:06:59.490
You can defeat me!

01:06:59.580 --> 01:07:02.450
Are these the only words you can squeeze out?

01:07:02.690 --> 01:07:06.160
What you just blabbed sounded like the bluff of a loser.

01:07:06.490 --> 01:07:08.120
Without support.

01:07:08.580 --> 01:07:09.080
I am...

01:07:09.860 --> 01:07:12.690
The man who will become the Pirate King!

01:07:14.510 --> 01:07:16.340
I already told you!

01:07:16.340 --> 01:07:20.970
There are many rookies like you in this sea!

01:07:21.490 --> 01:07:25.010
The more you get to know the level of this sea...

01:07:25.010 --> 01:07:27.640
The more you lose sight of those dreams!

01:07:37.440 --> 01:07:39.070
I am...

01:07:39.430 --> 01:07:41.130
The man...

01:07:41.130 --> 01:07:42.530
Who will surpass you!

01:07:46.050 --> 01:07:47.500
It's a nostalgic place, isn't it?

01:07:48.160 --> 01:07:50.130
The Suna Suna Clan secret base.

01:07:50.600 --> 01:07:51.250
Pell!

01:07:51.910 --> 01:07:54.220
The bomb has a timer.

01:07:54.220 --> 01:07:56.220
It'll blow up any minute now!

01:08:00.610 --> 01:08:02.720
I no longer...

01:08:03.600 --> 01:08:04.800
Vivi-sama...

01:08:04.800 --> 01:08:07.550
I'm really proud from the bottom of my heart...

01:08:10.810 --> 01:08:13.500
To have served the Nefertari family.

01:08:19.380 --> 01:08:25.830
Pell!

01:08:43.810 --> 01:08:45.250
I am...

01:08:45.250 --> 01:08:47.260
The Guardian of Arabasta!

01:08:52.670 --> 01:08:53.990
The Falcon!

01:08:57.880 --> 01:08:59.780
The one who destroys...

01:09:03.900 --> 01:09:06.020
The royal family's enemies!

01:09:25.320 --> 01:09:26.580
Hey, Pell.

01:09:26.580 --> 01:09:27.160
Yes?

01:09:27.160 --> 01:09:30.240
Why do you practice fencing everyday?

01:09:30.240 --> 01:09:31.750
Because I'm a guardian.

01:09:31.750 --> 01:09:34.060
In order to protect this country,

01:09:34.060 --> 01:09:35.660
I need to become stronger.

01:09:35.660 --> 01:09:37.590
Who are you going to fight?

01:09:37.590 --> 01:09:38.470
Well...

01:09:38.470 --> 01:09:41.020
It's more about protecting than fighting.

01:09:41.020 --> 01:09:42.560
Is it different?

01:09:42.560 --> 01:09:44.260
The intention is different.

01:09:45.520 --> 01:09:46.610
That's strange.

01:09:49.430 --> 01:09:49.990
Pell...

01:09:50.440 --> 01:09:51.710
That bastard...

01:09:51.710 --> 01:09:53.550
He protected the country.

01:09:55.280 --> 01:09:55.660
Oi.

01:09:57.250 --> 01:09:58.960
No way.

01:10:24.980 --> 01:10:26.730
Why don't they stop?

01:10:29.420 --> 01:10:30.930
Please stop!

01:10:31.610 --> 01:10:34.950
PLEASE, STOP FIGHTING!

01:10:35.280 --> 01:10:38.700
PLEASE, STOP FIGHTING!

01:10:39.400 --> 01:10:42.380
Please, stop fighting!

01:10:42.790 --> 01:10:43.630
Vivi...

01:10:43.750 --> 01:10:46.850
PLEASE, STOP FIGHTING!

01:10:47.650 --> 01:10:49.800
Please, stop fighting!

01:10:49.800 --> 01:10:51.210
You idiot...

01:10:51.440 --> 01:10:54.470
What're you just standing there for?!

01:10:54.470 --> 01:10:57.980
Punch them, kick them, and stop the rebellion!

01:10:59.030 --> 01:11:02.310
The scorpion's venom, without a doubt, has already taken effect.

01:11:05.160 --> 01:11:08.030
Where does this kid get his power from...?

01:11:10.030 --> 01:11:13.490
Who do you think I am?!

01:11:14.910 --> 01:11:16.700
I don't care who the hell you are!

01:11:17.400 --> 01:11:18.510
I...!

01:11:18.510 --> 01:11:19.410
Will...!

01:11:19.730 --> 01:11:21.870
Surpass you!

01:11:26.940 --> 01:11:27.710
Bastard!

01:11:28.350 --> 01:11:31.010
Sables Pesado: Heavy Sabers
Sables Pesado

01:11:51.910 --> 01:11:53.490
Gomu Gomu no

01:11:53.970 --> 01:11:55.330
Desert

01:11:55.560 --> 01:11:56.950
Storm!

01:11:56.950 --> 01:11:58.530
La Espada

01:12:36.790 --> 01:12:37.490
Oi! Look at that!

01:12:47.090 --> 01:12:49.090
Crocodile!

01:12:53.400 --> 01:12:55.240
Luffy... san...

01:13:02.440 --> 01:13:04.020
Oi, you!

01:13:08.120 --> 01:13:10.020
Even when there's no enemy...

01:13:13.490 --> 01:13:15.580
Are you alright?

01:13:17.800 --> 01:13:18.750
This is...

01:13:24.390 --> 01:13:28.210
Please, don't shed more blood.

01:13:28.560 --> 01:13:34.900
Please... STOP FIGHTING!

01:13:49.190 --> 01:13:50.100
Rain...

01:13:53.920 --> 01:13:54.650
It rained!

01:13:56.410 --> 01:14:00.870
Just like it's raining now, it will rain again like it did before.

01:14:01.990 --> 01:14:03.660
Vivi's voice reached them.

01:14:04.550 --> 01:14:05.500
It's Vivi-sama.

01:14:05.890 --> 01:14:07.330
Vivi-sama...

01:14:10.590 --> 01:14:13.500
The nightmare has ended.

01:14:19.430 --> 01:14:21.460
I thank you.

01:14:21.460 --> 01:14:23.100
Don't mention it.

01:14:30.990 --> 01:14:34.170
Armies, drop your weapons!

01:14:34.170 --> 01:14:35.210
Chaka-sama!

01:14:35.210 --> 01:14:36.400
Kohza-san!

01:14:36.790 --> 01:14:40.460
This battle was being manipulated from the beginning!

01:14:40.460 --> 01:14:41.990
By Crocodile!

01:14:55.310 --> 01:14:57.260
Everyone... where are you?

01:15:00.930 --> 01:15:02.000
He came.

01:15:03.930 --> 01:15:04.800
You guys are...?

01:15:06.110 --> 01:15:08.260
Thanks for bringing that guy you've got on your back.

01:15:08.850 --> 01:15:09.770
He's one of ours.

01:15:09.770 --> 01:15:11.020
The one in charge.

01:15:11.640 --> 01:15:12.510
Everyone!

01:15:12.510 --> 01:15:13.410
Papa?

01:15:13.410 --> 01:15:14.240
It's Vivi!

01:15:14.240 --> 01:15:15.270
Vivi...

01:15:16.410 --> 01:15:18.690
I see, so you're the ones who brought Vivi...

01:15:19.540 --> 01:15:21.500
He's the one who saved us.

01:15:21.500 --> 01:15:26.410
After fighting Crocodile, even with that wounded body of his, he carried two people out to the exit.

01:15:26.650 --> 01:15:28.620
What impressive will power...

01:15:28.620 --> 01:15:30.380
Let's hurry and treat his wounds.

01:15:30.380 --> 01:15:31.250
You guys too.

01:15:31.600 --> 01:15:34.420
Anyway, Vivi, you should hurry back to the plaza.

01:15:35.290 --> 01:15:39.690
At long last, after stopping the country's rebellion, a speech from the king and the princess...

01:15:39.690 --> 01:15:40.830
Is to be expected.

01:15:40.830 --> 01:15:42.430
Then, everyone also...

01:15:42.830 --> 01:15:44.400
You understand, right?

01:15:46.730 --> 01:15:50.270
We're just common people, we have nothing to do with this country or anything.

01:15:50.750 --> 01:15:52.020
I'm hungry.

01:15:52.620 --> 01:15:54.440
You can go to the palace if you want.

01:15:55.230 --> 01:15:56.810
I'm exhausted.

01:15:56.810 --> 01:15:57.500
Yes.

01:16:07.010 --> 01:16:08.830
Lamenting is natural.

01:16:08.830 --> 01:16:11.200
The thoughts of regret are also natural.

01:16:11.570 --> 01:16:14.420
The losses are many, the winnings are not.

01:16:15.030 --> 01:16:16.660
King.

01:16:16.660 --> 01:16:18.340
However, this is the time to move forward.

01:16:19.480 --> 01:16:21.780
No matter who the enemy we fought was...

01:16:21.780 --> 01:16:24.970
The battle that occurred here, is over now.

01:16:25.710 --> 01:16:29.810
No one can change what happened in the past!

01:16:29.810 --> 01:16:33.390
Let's stand above this war and show that we can keep existing!

01:16:33.930 --> 01:16:37.000
Kingdom of Arabasta!

01:16:47.160 --> 01:16:48.710
Look, Kohza.

01:16:48.710 --> 01:16:50.240
It rained.

01:16:52.410 --> 01:16:53.990
Just 3 years...

01:16:53.990 --> 01:16:56.230
It just took that time...

01:16:56.850 --> 01:16:58.010
Right?

01:16:58.010 --> 01:16:59.500
Rain...

01:17:20.900 --> 01:17:23.430
You are still awake, Vivi?

01:17:23.430 --> 01:17:24.030
Papa...

01:17:25.040 --> 01:17:25.990
You can't sleep?

01:17:27.470 --> 01:17:29.230
It's just that I don't want to sleep yet.

01:17:30.770 --> 01:17:33.760
I want to look at this rain a little more...

01:17:36.090 --> 01:17:38.970
Already the rain that wasn't forced to fall...

01:17:38.970 --> 01:17:43.260
For three days that rain hasn't stopped falling on this kingdom.

01:17:47.910 --> 01:17:48.840
What a great nap!

01:17:49.290 --> 01:17:50.480
Luffy!

01:17:56.740 --> 01:17:58.370
Ah! Where's my hat?

01:17:58.370 --> 01:17:58.880
Hat...

01:17:58.880 --> 01:17:59.970
I'm hungry!

01:17:59.970 --> 01:18:00.580
Where's breakfast?

01:18:00.580 --> 01:18:01.170
Where's my hat?

01:18:01.170 --> 01:18:02.610
I'm hungry!

01:18:02.610 --> 01:18:03.110
What a nice nap.

01:18:03.110 --> 01:18:04.560
I'm hungry.

01:18:04.560 --> 01:18:05.450
What a nice nap.

01:18:05.860 --> 01:18:06.570
I'm glad!

01:18:06.800 --> 01:18:08.620
Luffy-san is fully recovered.

01:18:09.160 --> 01:18:10.070
Ah! My hat!

01:18:11.020 --> 01:18:12.930
Oh! Thank goodness!

01:18:12.930 --> 01:18:14.690
Vivi, it's been a while!

01:18:16.390 --> 01:18:17.060
Ah? A while?

01:18:17.060 --> 01:18:20.120
Well, you slept for 3 days, so that means you're recovered, right?

01:18:20.570 --> 01:18:21.810
3 days?!

01:18:21.810 --> 01:18:24.380
That means I missed 15 meals?

01:18:24.380 --> 01:18:27.240
How come you're so fast calculating that?

01:18:27.240 --> 01:18:29.550
Although, you calculated 5 meals per day.

01:18:29.950 --> 01:18:32.930
If you want to eat, just say so anytime you want.

01:18:40.950 --> 01:18:42.190
That's dirty!

01:18:42.780 --> 01:18:45.870
Ah! Luffy, you got my plate!

01:18:46.420 --> 01:18:47.320
Oi, oi.

01:18:47.320 --> 01:18:49.590
There's still plenty...

01:18:49.590 --> 01:18:51.750
Are you Wapol?!

01:18:54.320 --> 01:18:55.490
Everyone, big trouble!

01:18:59.660 --> 01:19:03.210
A-a marine fleet is coming towards the country.

01:19:04.330 --> 01:19:05.670
Already?

01:19:06.020 --> 01:19:08.290
We'll... there's no reason to keep staying.

01:19:08.290 --> 01:19:10.380
The captain already woke up.

01:19:10.380 --> 01:19:12.430
The marines should be coming soon.

01:19:12.430 --> 01:19:14.310
Luffy, you decide.

01:19:14.310 --> 01:19:17.560
Yosh! We'll eat Arabasta food one more time and then leave.

01:19:17.560 --> 01:19:19.390
We're leaving sooner! You idiot!

01:19:23.710 --> 01:19:24.820
Hey, everyone...

01:19:25.700 --> 01:19:26.410
Vivi...

01:19:26.410 --> 01:19:27.550
I...

01:19:27.550 --> 01:19:29.270
What shall I do?

01:19:30.760 --> 01:19:32.510
Come with us, Vivi.

01:19:33.060 --> 01:19:35.490
Definitely come! Come now!

01:19:36.660 --> 01:19:41.840
Vivi, tomorrow at 12:00 p.m., we'll come by the eastern harbor one last time.

01:19:41.840 --> 01:19:44.570
If you want to keep traveling with us, please come.

01:19:44.570 --> 01:19:46.450
Then we'll have a welcome party.

01:19:46.450 --> 01:19:48.000
As pirates though.

01:19:48.000 --> 01:19:49.990
You're the princess of a country so,

01:19:49.990 --> 01:19:53.010
That's the best offer we can make.

01:19:56.770 --> 01:19:58.250
Carue...

01:19:59.150 --> 01:20:00.930
What would you want?

01:20:02.150 --> 01:20:03.450
I...

01:20:04.800 --> 01:20:08.900
I've been saved twice by two who hold the name "D"...

01:20:09.400 --> 01:20:11.360
Monkey D. Luffy and...

01:20:13.760 --> 01:20:14.740
Yosh! Let's go up!

01:20:15.240 --> 01:20:17.490
I no longer have a reason to keep living.

01:20:18.220 --> 01:20:20.070
Please, put me down!

01:20:21.730 --> 01:20:25.870
Why should I listen to what you say?

01:20:27.560 --> 01:20:30.000
Jaguar D. Saul...

01:20:30.350 --> 01:20:33.220
Someday, without a doubt, you'll find your nakama.

01:20:33.830 --> 01:20:35.080
There's nothing as absurd as...

01:20:35.080 --> 01:20:38.930
Being born into this world to be alone!

01:20:39.550 --> 01:20:43.010
My dream has too many enemies.

01:20:43.010 --> 01:20:44.890
Dereshishishi...

01:20:45.170 --> 01:20:47.320
Dereshishishi...

01:20:47.320 --> 01:20:49.880
They're definitely waiting for you somewhere in this sea...

01:20:49.880 --> 01:20:52.820
Go meet your nakama, Robin!

01:20:57.550 --> 01:21:00.970
The plaza is full of people already.

01:21:00.970 --> 01:21:02.010
Really?

01:21:02.010 --> 01:21:06.270
It was announced that Vivi-sama's speech would began at 12:00 p.m.

01:21:06.270 --> 01:21:09.330
Originally, it was going to take place when you were 14 years old...

01:21:09.330 --> 01:21:10.630
Your coming of age ceremony.

01:21:11.080 --> 01:21:13.640
Today, everyone is expecting it.

01:21:18.660 --> 01:21:20.250
I'm coming in, Vivi.

01:21:21.840 --> 01:21:23.350
Sit down, Papa.

01:21:24.190 --> 01:21:26.000
No... Father.

01:21:27.000 --> 01:21:28.440
I have something important to tell you.

01:21:43.710 --> 01:21:46.400
Look! It's Vivi-sama!

01:21:46.400 --> 01:21:47.790
Vivi-sama!

01:21:48.330 --> 01:21:49.640
We've been waiting!

01:21:49.640 --> 01:21:51.250
Princess!

01:21:51.560 --> 01:21:53.770
You've grown!

01:22:02.820 --> 01:22:05.810
I went on an adventure just for a while.

01:22:06.200 --> 01:22:08.770
Well... it's nothing to be alarmed about.

01:22:09.100 --> 01:22:10.870
Kohza! It started already!

01:22:10.870 --> 01:22:13.730
With something as big as that, it can be heard across the whole country.

01:22:15.060 --> 01:22:19.540
It started as a journey full of despair across a dark sea.

01:22:19.540 --> 01:22:20.700
On my dark journey...

01:22:20.960 --> 01:22:25.370
Inside a storm, I found one small ship.

01:22:25.370 --> 01:22:28.870
The ship pushed my back, saying...

01:22:29.830 --> 01:22:32.930
Can't you see that light?

01:22:34.970 --> 01:22:39.380
Without losing it's course within the darkness, that ship...

01:22:39.380 --> 01:22:42.750
Surpassed the big waves as if it were dancing.

01:22:43.530 --> 01:22:46.590
Never opposing the sea, always going forward!

01:22:47.390 --> 01:22:49.100
Then, a finger raised.

01:22:49.490 --> 01:22:51.970
Look, a light appeared.

01:22:53.720 --> 01:22:57.490
History, before long, will call this an illusion, but...

01:22:58.840 --> 01:23:02.100
To me, that's the only truth!

01:23:08.220 --> 01:23:10.210
Did you hear the speech just now?

01:23:10.210 --> 01:23:11.880
Without a doubt it's Vivi's voice.

01:23:11.880 --> 01:23:12.820
Vivi...

01:23:12.820 --> 01:23:14.660
It might be a voice similar to Vivi's.

01:23:14.660 --> 01:23:16.670
It's a ceremony being broadcast from Alubarna.

01:23:16.670 --> 01:23:18.330
She already decided not to come.

01:23:18.330 --> 01:23:19.960
Let's go, it's past 12:00 p.m..

01:23:20.580 --> 01:23:22.170
There's no way she won't come.

01:23:22.170 --> 01:23:23.280
Let's get out and search.

01:23:23.280 --> 01:23:24.520
She must be nearby.

01:23:24.520 --> 01:23:26.000
This is bad.

01:23:26.000 --> 01:23:27.770
The marine fleet is coming.

01:23:27.770 --> 01:23:28.560
They already came?!

01:23:29.020 --> 01:23:30.080
Prepare the ship.

01:23:30.080 --> 01:23:31.980
Give it up, Luffy.

01:23:31.980 --> 01:23:33.260
Vivi-chan is a princess.

01:23:34.710 --> 01:23:36.610
What the hell is going on?!

01:23:36.780 --> 01:23:39.570
Show your face, fake princess!

01:23:39.570 --> 01:23:42.230
Where's the real Vivi-sama?!

01:23:43.810 --> 01:23:45.620
Vivi-sama must now be...

01:23:48.720 --> 01:23:51.580
Everyone!

01:23:51.950 --> 01:23:52.810
Vivi!

01:23:53.450 --> 01:23:54.880
Carue!

01:23:55.020 --> 01:23:57.590
Everyone!

01:23:58.290 --> 01:23:59.400
See?! She came!

01:23:59.400 --> 01:23:59.950
Vivi!

01:23:59.950 --> 01:24:01.800
Yosh! I'm turning back the ship!

01:24:02.090 --> 01:24:03.650
She came after all!

01:24:05.110 --> 01:24:06.880
Oi! Hurry up and turn back the ship.

01:24:06.880 --> 01:24:08.270
I came...

01:24:09.020 --> 01:24:10.830
To say goodbye!

01:24:12.770 --> 01:24:13.940
What did... she say just now?

01:24:16.300 --> 01:24:20.620
I can't go with you!

01:24:20.620 --> 01:24:22.610
Who is she shouting to?

01:24:22.920 --> 01:24:26.740
Really, thank you for everything until now!

01:24:27.820 --> 01:24:31.810
I want to keep going on adventures but, after all I...

01:24:31.810 --> 01:24:35.250
Love this country!

01:24:44.560 --> 01:24:47.240
So, I can't go...

01:24:52.020 --> 01:24:53.160
I see.

01:24:53.830 --> 01:24:55.280
I...

01:24:59.740 --> 01:25:02.530
I'm... staying here but...

01:25:03.140 --> 01:25:04.500
If someday...

01:25:06.020 --> 01:25:06.990
We meet again...

01:25:08.010 --> 01:25:09.320
Will you one more time...

01:25:09.830 --> 01:25:14.230
Call me Nakama?!

01:25:20.830 --> 01:25:22.300
We'll always be naka...!

01:25:22.800 --> 01:25:24.150
Don't answer!

01:25:24.150 --> 01:25:25.260
The marines are nearby.

01:25:25.850 --> 01:25:28.390
If they find out that we have something to do with Vivi...

01:25:28.650 --> 01:25:30.600
Vivi will also become a criminal.

01:25:30.900 --> 01:25:33.750
This will have to be a silent farewell.

01:26:02.840 --> 01:26:05.500
From now on, if anything happens,

01:26:12.880 --> 01:26:15.220
Show this on your left arm!

01:26:33.780 --> 01:26:36.790
It's the mark of nakama!

01:26:45.300 --> 01:26:48.630
Depart!

01:26:57.370 --> 01:27:02.720
There's something I want to protect
Mamoritai mono ga aru

01:27:02.720 --> 01:27:08.700
In this place where I became strong
Kono basho de tsuyoku naru kara

01:27:08.700 --> 01:27:18.910
This fist I once clenched tightly, I clenched again
Nigirishimeta kobushi wo mata nigirishimeta

01:27:20.360 --> 01:27:30.360
The important thing is to convey it in words
Hontou ni daiji na koto wa kotoba dewa tsutawaranai

01:27:30.360 --> 01:27:35.280
Slowly slowly now
Yukkuri to yukkuri to ima

01:27:35.280 --> 01:27:41.720
I was gazing at that back
Sono senaka wo mitsumete itanda

01:27:41.720 --> 01:27:51.700
Now I know the way to live is something you decide by yourself
Dou ikiru ka wa jibun de kimeru koto da to wakatta

01:27:51.700 --> 01:28:01.290
True courage was definitely graceful, wasn't it?
Hontou no yuuki wa kitto yasashisa dattanda ne

01:28:01.290 --> 01:28:12.300
Although I decided not to cry, I couldn't stop the tears from overflowing
Nakanai koto wo kimeta hazu na no ni namida afurete tomaranakatta yo

01:28:12.300 --> 01:28:17.670
It isn't lonely, it isn't sad
Samishiin janai kanashiin janai

01:28:17.670 --> 01:28:22.860
Because I've been given courage
Yuuki wo kureta kara nanda

01:28:25.360 --> 01:28:36.670
The morning you decided to set out, I couldn't do anything to stop you
Tabidachi wo kimeta asa tomeru koto dekinakatta yo

01:28:36.670 --> 01:28:48.340
Though our paths have diverged, I believe in you
Michi no tsuzuki chigau keredo shinjiteru yo

01:28:48.340 --> 01:28:58.250
Anyone destined only for solitude is bound to have a heartache, it seems
Daremo ga kodoku no kazu dake kokoro itame tsuke au darou

01:28:58.250 --> 01:29:12.210
I'll never forget our bonds
Kizuna wo wasurenaide

01:29:15.470 --> 01:29:17.360
What's this?

01:29:17.360 --> 01:29:18.710
This?

01:29:18.710 --> 01:29:20.160
It's a nakama mark.

01:29:20.160 --> 01:29:21.270
Nakama?

01:29:21.270 --> 01:29:22.280
Yes.

01:29:22.280 --> 01:29:25.060
The mark of very important nakama.

01:29:28.390 --> 01:29:31.240
Everyone, are you doing well?

01:29:31.960 --> 01:29:34.240
Right now, where are you traveling to?

01:29:34.920 --> 01:29:39.320
Sometimes I remember the memories of back then and come here.

01:29:40.720 --> 01:29:42.500
Because, I...

01:29:43.230 --> 01:29:44.520
We...

01:29:45.480 --> 01:29:48.230
Will always be nakama!
